+issueNumber: MDL-89726
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new `get_preload_urls()` method has been added to
+        `\core\output\requirements\import_map`. It returns the URL of each
+        concrete (non-prefix) import map entry for the active theme, and
+        `\core\output\requirements\page_requirements_manager::get_import_map()`
+        now emits a `<link rel="modulepreload">` tag for each of these entries
+        immediately after the `importmap` script tag so that the browser can
+        start fetching foundational ES module dependencies (`react`,
+        `react-dom`, `tabbable`, `bootstrap`, and the active theme's design
+        system bundle) in parallel with page parsing.
